'''Ike''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Michael's Crib}} on the {{zone|Spiders Den}}. He introduces the player to [[Mob Types]].

== Purpose ==
'''Ike''' tracks which [[Mob Types]] the player has killed. Killing a new type for the first time unlocks a claimable reward, including {{Skill XP|1,000 Combat}}, {{Coins|1,000}}, and {{SkyBlock XP|1}}.

